│ randomized controlled trial. We evaluated self-care efficacy, knowledge, behavior, and QoL at baseline and 3 months. │
│ RESULTS We enrolled 61 participants: intervention 42, usual care 19; mean age\u2009±\u2009SD: 55\u2009±\u200910      │
│ years; 64% male; 75% white Hispanic, 25% African American; and 56% high school education or less. Comparison of the  │
│ two groups with respect to changes from baseline to 3 months showed significant differences for Self-Efficacy for    │
│ Managing Chronic Disease (2.09\u2009±\u20092.32, p-value\u2009=\u20090.005); health distress scale                   │
