Review: mHealth education interventions in heart failure
Total studies to screen: 34

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included studies if they were conducted as a randomised controlled trial (RCT), involving adults (≥ 18 years) with a 
diagnosis of HF. We included trials comparing mHealth‐delivered education such as internet and web‐based education 
programmes for use on smartphones and tablets (including apps) and other mobile devices, SMS messages and social 
media‐delivered education programmes, versus usual HF care.

