│ illness. The project targeted chronic patients with obstructive pulmonary disease, cardiac failure and/or type II    │
│ diabetes mellitus. SETTING One health care sector in Spain (Barcelona) (n = 11.382); six municipalities in Norway    │
│ (Trondheim) (n = 450); and one hospital in Greece (Athens) (n = 388). METHOD The four services were: (i) Home-based  │
