│ - Apply the above inclusion/exclusion criteria focusing on mHealth-delivered education for HF.                       │
│ - If eligibility is insufficiently clear from title/abstract, you may mark as 'unclear' per your standard.           │
│ - Return your standard Gatekeeper chunk response in the benchmark-expected schema for exactly these indices.         │
