│ surgery decisions: a randomized trial among patients with low health literacy", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To evaluate   │
│ an entertainment-based patient decision aid for early stage breast cancer surgery in low health literacy patients.   │
│ METHODS Newly diagnosed female patients with early stage breast cancer from two public hospitals were randomized to  │
