  - "study_index": integer matching exactly the provided one-based index for that study.                                
  - "label": one of "include" or "exclude".                                                                             
  - "rationale": a concise (<=40 words) reason aligned with the criteria (do not quote long text).                      
- Do NOT include study titles, abstracts, or other raw study text in the output.                                        
- Include each and only the study_index values from this chunk exactly once.                                            
                                                                                                                        
Screen precisely and only the attached chunk.                                                                           
"""                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                        
