- Study 168: General mHealth app retention cohort; no HF diagnosis focus; not an RCT of HF mHealth education.           
- Study 169: HF RCT but intervention is automated telephone calls and telemedicine triage; telephone-only, not mHealth  
education as defined.                                                                                                   
- Study 170: Non-randomized protocol in HF; fails RCT criterion.                                                        
- Study 171: Protocol for telemonitoring plus telephone nurse coaching post-HF discharge; relies on                     
