- Study 172: Web-based symptom tool usability; not an RCT; desktop/web focus rather than mobile education versus usual  
care.                                                                                                                   
- Study 173: Narrative on technology training for ICD patients; not HF-focused RCT; not a primary trial.                
- Study 174: Guideline document; not an interventional RCT.                                                             
- Study 175: Review of registries/burden; no intervention.                                                              
